# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
# 裸 debug 会误伤 plugins-src/debug（官方插件源码目录，须入库）；
# 仅排除非 target 的构建产物（如 client Gradle 的 debug 变体中间目录）。
!plugins-src/debug/
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# 本地 AI 助手工作记忆（仅本地使用，不进版本库）
.workbuddy/


.DS_Store

config.toml

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# 技能库第三方引用（KuiklyUI 源码参考，119M，不入库）
.agents/skills/**/references/

**/*.log

# Isolated local admin development database and managed assets
/.dev/

# WASM 插件产物：一律不入库（用户方向 2026-11-04）——本地/CI 按需构建，
# 生产由镜像随附的系统插件目录或管理界面上传已构建组件。源码即唯一入库物。
server/tests/fixtures/wasm/*.wasm
# tools/build-system-plugins.sh 的统一产物目录同样不入库
/build/

# client/admin-web（React + shadcn/ui + Tauri 2 管理台）本地产物
client/admin-web/node_modules/
client/admin-web/dist/
client/admin-web/.vite/
client/admin-web/.env.local
client/admin-web/.env.*.local
client/admin-web/src-tauri/gen/
# client/admin-web/src-tauri/target 由上方通用 target 规则覆盖

# WorkBuddy safe-delete shim 的删除链路异常时，Python tempfile._get_default_tempdir()
# 会把候选目录一路试到 cwd，在仓库根留下 8 字符随机名、内容为 b"blat" 的 4 字节
# 探测文件（偶尔另有 _tmp_<pid>_* 的 0 字节占位）。这些不是项目产物，忽略以免污染
# git status；清理时先核对再删：
#   find . -maxdepth 1 -type f -size 4c -name '????????' -print
#   find . -maxdepth 1 -type f -size 4c -name '????????' -delete
/[a-z0-9_][a-z0-9_][a-z0-9_][a-z0-9_][a-z0-9_][a-z0-9_][a-z0-9_][a-z0-9_]
/_tmp_*
